description:
in this dish, you are limited only by your imagination. you have a world of ingredients to choose from. in addition to the ingredients called for in this recipe, some additional possibilities for enhancing your migas are:
crispy cooked and crumbled bacon;
 chopped ham;
 crumbled chorizo (browned before you add the eggs);
 cooked, shredded chicken or turkey;
 grated or diced potatoes (sauteed until tender before adding the eggs;
 poblano chiles;
 green bell pepper;
 your favorite hot sauce;
 green onion;
 cayenne pepper (a dash or so);
 minced garlic. 

as long as your dish contains the requisite tortillas, you will still have migas. of course, if you omit the tortillas, you'll still have a delicious, satisfying dish, but you won't have migas.
